WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:52.969
"In truth, I was embarrassed.

00:00:54.929 --> 00:01:00.477
Every burning touch of your hand
upon my body

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:04.773
caused a stirring and rising heat,

00:01:05.356 --> 00:01:06.733
and my body twisted.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:09.736
And I was…

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:12.947
embarrassed quite abundantly.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.576
It was also painful

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:20.622
once you were fully inside of me…

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:26.795
as if my flesh were being flayed,
and it left me in a daze.

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:29.422
However…

00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:35.887
Ah, the instant
I felt your skin moving inside of me,

00:01:37.555 --> 00:01:39.682
I realized, once and for all.

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:46.731
And let me say,
however many nights I have left,

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:48.525
I wish to share with you

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:51.319
and to stay with you
until my days run out.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:02:01.162
Pray, stay beside me
as you are beside me now."

00:02:14.008 --> 00:02:16.636
That woman is such a sorry simpleton.

00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:22.142
She's as amusing as she is pathetic.

00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:28.148
Now, cousin, won't you tell me
how you experienced that?

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.861
Tell me, was there
a stirring in your bones

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:36.114
as the young widow lay down?

00:02:36.906 --> 00:02:39.701
The lady never had a man,
at least not really.

00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:44.998
She latched on to my neck…

00:02:46.457 --> 00:02:48.626
then she begged me with her eyes.

00:02:55.383 --> 00:02:57.510
How warm and tender that was.

00:02:58.261 --> 00:02:59.846
Oh, was it, pray tell?

00:03:04.726 --> 00:03:06.352
I take it you're displeased.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.563
And if I am, so what?

00:03:09.606 --> 00:03:12.150
You know as well as I, dear cousin,

00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:14.611
why I went to such lengths.

00:03:16.321 --> 00:03:18.448
Everything is because of you.

00:03:21.743 --> 00:03:22.869
Now, then…

00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:27.790
Will this finally be the day?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.422
For so long, I've been expecting that.

00:04:13.211 --> 00:04:16.714
Yet, we'll have to delay this…

00:04:17.674 --> 00:04:19.676
bestowing of your reward.

00:04:20.677 --> 00:04:23.888
I was enjoined to see
a matter of great tenor.

00:04:47.829 --> 00:04:48.955
What on earth…

00:04:51.874 --> 00:04:53.126
Oh, my God.

00:04:53.209 --> 00:04:57.005
I hear you were directed to retrieve
the remains of the young widow.

00:04:57.088 --> 00:05:00.341
Still, I knew you'd be thinking
of that wretched wager.

00:05:00.425 --> 00:05:02.427
So, I thought I'd write it on your behalf.

00:05:03.928 --> 00:05:05.513
But I did not realize

00:05:05.596 --> 00:05:08.808
how very desperately the young widow
has come to cling to this life.

00:05:10.768 --> 00:05:13.896
She has forgotten
all about her promises, I guess.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:15.565
What are you saying?

00:05:17.275 --> 00:05:19.652
I wrote a marriage proposal letter.

00:05:19.736 --> 00:05:21.612
And certain promises have been made.

00:05:24.532 --> 00:05:27.452
Notably that she will, at the very least,

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:30.413
fulfill her duty
and let death carry her off.

00:05:32.415 --> 00:05:34.459
It is fitting and apt, is it not?

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:39.422
That's how it is. Her life ends now.

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:44.385
It is regrettable to learn
that she is still alive,

00:05:44.469 --> 00:05:46.637
though it won't matter much, I guess.

00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:48.890
For, as we know,

00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:51.976
death will occur in the end.

00:05:53.895 --> 00:05:55.897
All you need to do, dear cousin,

00:05:56.439 --> 00:05:59.108
is take what I have written
and present it to His Majesty.

00:05:59.692 --> 00:06:01.527
Go to him with these words,

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:06.574
that some are saying
that they saw an abominable thing.

00:06:07.075 --> 00:06:09.035
A woman who threw herself off a cliff.

00:06:09.118 --> 00:06:12.872
Are you telling me
that I should tell a despicable lie?

00:06:12.955 --> 00:06:16.417
When the young widow hears
what everyone says happened,

00:06:17.418 --> 00:06:21.672
she will know that the only option
she has is to end it all.

00:06:22.298 --> 00:06:24.133
And, gladly, she will do so.

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:28.805
Then, all shall be restored
to its rightful place.

00:06:29.764 --> 00:06:32.475
Your concern for me
may be heavenly in aspect…

00:06:34.268 --> 00:06:38.773
…however, this kindness, dear cousin,
is far too much.

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:40.900
This thing

00:06:41.984 --> 00:06:44.904
shouldn't really involve you at all.

00:06:44.987 --> 00:06:46.656
Really? Do you think so?

00:06:48.116 --> 00:06:49.200
Dear cousin,

00:06:50.827 --> 00:06:52.703
can you recall the day that you…

00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:58.334
took my verse, which I wrote for you,
and brought the family honor?

00:07:00.211 --> 00:07:03.798
As I did then, I am merely trying
to come to your assistance.

00:07:07.009 --> 00:07:08.970
I'll never forget it,
of that you can be sure.

00:07:09.804 --> 00:07:12.932
Yes, I remember well
that piercing gaze you fixed on me.

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:17.186
If it were possible, cousin…

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.358
If I could go back in time,

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:25.278
I would say I did not write those lines,

00:07:25.361 --> 00:07:27.488
that you wrote it all,
right from the beginning.

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:30.491
And I…

00:07:36.038 --> 00:07:38.624
I am no longer the child I had been.

00:07:46.424 --> 00:07:48.426
-Won…
-Do not call me that.

00:07:49.218 --> 00:07:52.638
You say you wrote that to help me,
as you were helping me then?

00:07:54.891 --> 00:07:56.142
Then so be it.

00:07:56.809 --> 00:07:57.894
Very well.

00:07:59.437 --> 00:08:02.106
In that case, I ask, as I did then,

00:08:03.107 --> 00:08:05.193
to hold my hand once more.

00:08:08.905 --> 00:08:10.990
And this time you will come along.

00:08:41.938 --> 00:08:43.105
I'm glad…

00:08:46.275 --> 00:08:48.569
at last I heard you speak these words.

00:08:52.865 --> 00:08:54.909
I've waited so long for you

00:08:56.118 --> 00:08:58.579
to ask that I follow you again.

00:09:01.749 --> 00:09:03.793
I couldn't stop thinking about it,

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:06.671
since the day that I could not go to you…

00:09:08.422 --> 00:09:13.511
About the ferry boat I had to watch
through my tears drift away.

00:09:16.472 --> 00:09:19.725
And I've wondered
if I might see that ferry once again.

00:09:23.271 --> 00:09:25.356
So please, do tell me more.

00:09:27.024 --> 00:09:29.485
Tell me of the future you envision for us.

00:09:31.737 --> 00:09:34.448
Even now, I would enjoy
hearing you speak of that.

00:09:38.244 --> 00:09:40.830
And of Yanjing,
where they say that wonders

00:09:41.664 --> 00:09:43.541
of every sort are gathered.

00:09:45.126 --> 00:09:47.128
Hmm?

00:10:21.162 --> 00:10:22.496
Cho Won…

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.297
Cho Won.

00:10:38.846 --> 00:10:41.390
I wished to call you by your name.

00:10:52.026 --> 00:10:53.027
Hui-yeon.

00:10:55.196 --> 00:10:56.530
Mmm.

00:10:58.032 --> 00:10:59.033
Hui-yeon.

00:11:46.872 --> 00:11:48.749
My lady…

00:11:53.504 --> 00:11:55.631
The Young Master In-ho was here.

00:11:58.467 --> 00:12:00.511
He was outside the gate a minute ago.

00:12:00.594 --> 00:12:02.138
He was watching me there.

00:12:13.023 --> 00:12:15.818
My lord, where we go doesn't matter to me.

00:12:18.863 --> 00:12:20.865
You must come away with me,
that's what matters.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.077
Won't you come away with me, please?

00:12:35.713 --> 00:12:37.631
It's going to be fine.

00:12:38.257 --> 00:12:42.178
My heart is filled with joy
now that you've told me that.

00:12:43.387 --> 00:12:45.264
Improper as it might be, yes.

00:12:49.643 --> 00:12:50.728
All right.

00:12:51.729 --> 00:12:53.022
Where shall we go now?

00:12:54.398 --> 00:12:55.566
Across the sea?

00:12:55.649 --> 00:12:56.734
I think not.

00:12:58.194 --> 00:12:59.945
What if we went to Yanjing?

00:13:00.446 --> 00:13:01.989
No one will ever find us.

00:13:06.786 --> 00:13:07.787
Mm-hmm.

00:13:13.209 --> 00:13:17.505
How I've waited for you
to ask me to leave with you again.

00:13:17.588 --> 00:13:19.340
It doesn't matter where.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:25.262
How about Yanjing, where they say
that wonders of every sort are gathered?

00:13:27.097 --> 00:13:28.098
Hmm?

00:13:39.026 --> 00:13:40.611
How long I've been waiting…

00:13:46.867 --> 00:13:48.661
waiting to hear you say that.

00:13:53.999 --> 00:13:55.793
Tell me more now, won't you?

00:13:57.461 --> 00:13:58.504
About…

00:14:00.172 --> 00:14:01.507
our future together.

00:14:31.287 --> 00:14:33.247
There is one more thing you must hear.

00:14:33.789 --> 00:14:35.624
His Majesty has given me a command

00:14:36.125 --> 00:14:37.376
to retrieve the remains

00:14:37.459 --> 00:14:39.795
of the Left State Councilor's
daughter-in-law,

00:14:41.005 --> 00:14:43.507
now that she has bid farewell
and passed away.

00:14:46.302 --> 00:14:47.845
Whatever it takes,

00:14:49.263 --> 00:14:52.141
I'll manage to find a way, so I think… I…

00:14:52.641 --> 00:14:54.226
You, my lady, should go on ahead.

00:14:55.686 --> 00:14:57.021
No, I refuse.

00:14:57.521 --> 00:14:59.398
Did you not say you wanted to live?

00:15:14.663 --> 00:15:16.582
Yes, I have made it very clear…

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:22.630
that I want to be living with you,
my lord.

00:15:28.594 --> 00:15:29.845
That cannot be.

00:15:49.865 --> 00:15:51.492
Hyah! Hyah!

00:15:53.118 --> 00:15:56.205
The truth is,
I have come to ask you a favor.

00:15:56.288 --> 00:15:58.874
I need to find someone
a position right away.

00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:00.209
Who's that?

00:16:00.292 --> 00:16:02.336
-A woman.
-A… A woman?

00:16:02.419 --> 00:16:04.088
A woman in disguise.

00:16:04.171 --> 00:16:06.382
Huh. Oh-Oh…

00:16:13.222 --> 00:16:16.475
Young master, please rise.
I have brought some porridge for you.

00:16:16.558 --> 00:16:18.185
I have a terrible headache.

00:16:19.436 --> 00:16:20.771
Oh, a headache?

00:16:20.854 --> 00:16:22.398
In-ho… Oh, goodness.

00:16:23.273 --> 00:16:26.819
What on earth has befallen you?

00:16:27.569 --> 00:16:28.570
Oh.

00:16:37.621 --> 00:16:39.415
I told you I don't wish to eat.
Why do you…

00:16:39.498 --> 00:16:40.624
Shh.

00:16:57.933 --> 00:17:00.269
I didn't know your manners
were so inappropriate.

00:17:01.437 --> 00:17:03.480
You could've let me know a little sooner.

00:17:10.112 --> 00:17:12.823
You're in no position
to laugh at me right now.

00:17:17.619 --> 00:17:19.872
The girl, my brother-in-law's concubine…

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.586
…has asked me to deliver this to you.

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:32.217
No one ever informed me

00:17:32.301 --> 00:17:35.012
that you are a man who lusts after women.

00:17:35.763 --> 00:17:37.306
I could've done something.

00:17:39.433 --> 00:17:42.770
I could have thoroughly warned
my cousin about you.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:49.276
I wonder what His Excellency
will have to say.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.161
What…

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:05.793
Master, I'm…

00:18:05.876 --> 00:18:07.044
Hey, wait.

00:18:08.378 --> 00:18:11.215
What is it, young master?
Why are you acting like that?

00:18:15.969 --> 00:18:17.471
Don't worry too much.

00:18:17.554 --> 00:18:19.848
I'm not going to speak of this to anybody.

00:18:19.932 --> 00:18:23.685
As a scholar-official, one's duty
is to protect the honor of the family.

00:18:25.312 --> 00:18:26.522
However, there are…

00:18:28.315 --> 00:18:31.693
delicate matters which,
once uncovered, can't be handled.

00:19:53.358 --> 00:19:57.946
You said you're no longer
the child that you once were.

00:20:00.782 --> 00:20:02.451
But, as for me,

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:06.622
to come away with you once again,
dear cousin,

00:20:08.248 --> 00:20:09.499
it was like I was

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:13.503
reunited with the compassionate man
I knew when I was young.

00:20:15.005 --> 00:20:17.216
My whole body shook with impatience.

00:20:28.518 --> 00:20:31.647
So, Hwaseong. I heard you went there

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:35.525
in order to have done
with the quandary of the young widow?

00:20:36.693 --> 00:20:37.694
Yes.

00:20:41.114 --> 00:20:42.324
And if, in the end,

00:20:42.407 --> 00:20:44.701
we circled back to where it all began,

00:20:46.036 --> 00:20:48.914
then I would say
that silly wager was unnecessary.

00:20:50.958 --> 00:20:54.670
Tell me, the young widow,
what happened in the end?

00:20:54.753 --> 00:20:56.964
Did she go away without any ado?

00:21:02.594 --> 00:21:05.847
Her strength seemed gone,
as was any lingering attachment.

00:21:09.184 --> 00:21:10.936
She will die by her own hand.

00:21:15.148 --> 00:21:16.275
It'll happen soon.

00:21:19.736 --> 00:21:21.029
I think that's true.

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:25.951
I am relieved in a way, I guess.

00:21:28.036 --> 00:21:29.788
One obstacle has arisen.

00:21:31.123 --> 00:21:32.249
Though I know not how,

00:21:33.041 --> 00:21:34.710
the Left State Councilor's son…

00:21:36.753 --> 00:21:38.505
learned about this entire matter.

00:21:39.089 --> 00:21:41.383
We can trust the young master, I'd say.

00:21:42.134 --> 00:21:43.885
He is of a tender disposition,

00:21:44.386 --> 00:21:46.722
and I'm sure
he won't be speaking out of turn.

00:21:48.598 --> 00:21:49.683
What is more distressing

00:21:51.393 --> 00:21:53.437
is that this matter has been told

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.398
to the Lady of the First Rank.

00:21:57.566 --> 00:21:59.276
I should've told you right away,

00:21:59.776 --> 00:22:02.321
but I feared
I might cause you needless worry.

00:22:03.322 --> 00:22:07.784
She has made it plain she could ignore
the troubles that we're talking about

00:22:07.868 --> 00:22:11.913
so long as approval for the Memorial Gate
for Virtuous Women is forthcoming.

00:22:11.997 --> 00:22:14.958
She asked me
to ensure the project goes through.

00:22:15.584 --> 00:22:17.252
Have you been blackmailed?

00:22:20.672 --> 00:22:23.633
It was a request to be of help in this.

00:22:23.717 --> 00:22:26.178
-Oh, cousin.
-Go to His Majesty

00:22:26.261 --> 00:22:29.139
and say the words exactly
as I have written them down.

00:22:29.222 --> 00:22:31.099
I pray that is all you need to do.

00:22:31.600 --> 00:22:33.894
Then no one and nothing will trouble you

00:22:34.394 --> 00:22:37.230
or trouble me with this ever again,
dear cousin.

00:22:42.486 --> 00:22:43.487
All right.

00:22:54.790 --> 00:22:57.667
I held on to this
to show you when you returned.

00:22:58.585 --> 00:22:59.586
Here it is.

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:02.923
Isn't that you, my lord?

00:23:04.508 --> 00:23:06.134
THERE WAS A MAN
WHO WENT ABOUT SCOLDING

00:23:06.218 --> 00:23:07.761
MOIST WOMANHOODS
WITH HIS LARGE HANDS

00:23:16.436 --> 00:23:17.437
And…

00:23:19.064 --> 00:23:20.315
Where did you get this?

00:23:20.399 --> 00:23:23.026
Eun-sil's mistress wanted it burned,

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:25.570
but the women of the house
were all passing it around.

00:23:26.238 --> 00:23:28.824
Eun-sil thought perhaps you should see it,

00:23:28.907 --> 00:23:30.409
so she traded for it.

00:23:30.492 --> 00:23:32.077
Cost her some dried beef too.

00:23:33.036 --> 00:23:36.081
-Bun-hui…
-Bun-hui?

00:23:37.249 --> 00:23:38.792
-Bun-hui.
-Bun-hui.

00:23:48.009 --> 00:23:50.345
Go to Mapo Ferry Crossing. I need a favor.

00:23:51.138 --> 00:23:53.056
-Hmm.
-I shall leave for Yanjing.

00:23:53.557 --> 00:23:55.767
Yanjing? The Great State?

00:23:56.476 --> 00:23:58.061
Whether by ship or by road,

00:23:58.979 --> 00:24:01.148
find the swiftest and most discreet route.

00:24:01.731 --> 00:24:02.774
One other thing…

00:24:05.569 --> 00:24:07.946
It should be comfortable enough
for a woman to travel it.

00:24:08.029 --> 00:24:09.698
Ah, a woman?

00:24:09.781 --> 00:24:12.117
-Who else could catch your eye so…
-What about Eun-sil?

00:24:12.617 --> 00:24:14.035
You'll leave her behind?

00:24:15.954 --> 00:24:17.414
Eun-sil?

00:24:17.497 --> 00:24:19.916
Eun… Eun-sil is coming with us to Yanjing?

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:21.001
Truly?

00:24:21.501 --> 00:24:22.836
I have to be somewhere.

00:24:23.336 --> 00:24:24.880
Do a good job with that.

00:24:24.963 --> 00:24:25.964
I will.

00:24:36.475 --> 00:24:37.642
Dear cousin…

00:24:40.270 --> 00:24:42.189
I see you're going somewhere.

00:24:52.491 --> 00:24:54.743
I'm making arrangements for us
to leave together, am I not?

00:24:57.746 --> 00:24:58.997
Oh, but…

00:24:59.080 --> 00:25:01.374
Then when will you go to see His Majesty?

00:25:05.504 --> 00:25:06.505
It will not be long.

00:25:11.676 --> 00:25:15.722
If you fasten this so loosely,
it will soon come undone.

00:25:20.560 --> 00:25:22.354
Tighten it around you like so.

00:25:25.982 --> 00:25:26.983
There you are.

00:25:27.609 --> 00:25:28.944
Be careful on the road.

00:25:33.740 --> 00:25:35.909
I shall.

00:25:36.618 --> 00:25:37.619
Hmm.

00:25:54.511 --> 00:25:55.845
Hyah!

00:25:57.931 --> 00:25:58.932
Hyah!

00:26:12.529 --> 00:26:13.905
Oh, young master!

00:26:16.491 --> 00:26:18.868
What's the matter?

00:26:22.080 --> 00:26:26.418
I only went out for a moment,
and when I came back, she was gone.

00:26:27.502 --> 00:26:29.170
I humbly apologize, young master.

00:26:29.254 --> 00:26:30.422
That's all right.

00:26:31.464 --> 00:26:32.966
I'm the one who did this.

00:26:36.136 --> 00:26:38.221
Oh, dear.

00:26:44.603 --> 00:26:47.188
Tell me then,
when will your mother be arriving?

00:26:47.272 --> 00:26:52.193
That is… I don't think
she will be able to come today.

00:26:53.028 --> 00:26:57.073
Uh… She's gone to Mapo Ferry Crossing
to get tobacco from Qing.

00:26:57.157 --> 00:26:59.826
And she always likes
to verify it all herself.

00:27:00.327 --> 00:27:03.455
So, I don't think she'll be back
until sunset, madam.

00:27:04.497 --> 00:27:06.666
-Is that so?
-Yes, madam.

00:27:08.543 --> 00:27:11.463
I have entrusted
a certain matter to your mother,

00:27:11.546 --> 00:27:13.715
but I've had no word from her
in quite some time,

00:27:13.798 --> 00:27:15.258
so I've come in person.

00:27:17.052 --> 00:27:20.096
Perhaps if I had been more kind
in my instructions,

00:27:20.180 --> 00:27:23.141
she would have responded
with greater urgency.

00:27:23.767 --> 00:27:27.187
I am not fond of repeating myself,
much less several times…

00:27:30.231 --> 00:27:32.150
so this I shall not say a third time.

00:27:32.734 --> 00:27:34.277
I shall give you a fortnight.

00:27:34.861 --> 00:27:36.529
Do make sure they're all gone.

00:27:39.616 --> 00:27:42.952
I have worked too hard
to preserve my honor and reputation

00:27:43.036 --> 00:27:46.081
to let gossip tarnish them in this way.

00:27:50.585 --> 00:27:51.836
I'll count on you to tell her.

00:27:54.923 --> 00:27:56.466
Yes, madam.

00:28:01.638 --> 00:28:03.515
How could she do this to me, hmm?

00:28:04.015 --> 00:28:07.519
When So-ok's belly begins to swell,
she'll be relegated to the back room.

00:28:07.602 --> 00:28:11.022
The gall. How could she do this to me?

00:28:11.606 --> 00:28:13.608
Oh, Mother, is there anything wrong?

00:28:13.692 --> 00:28:15.735
What do you think? Huh?

00:28:15.819 --> 00:28:17.278
I'm so angry I could die!

00:28:17.362 --> 00:28:18.571
Yet, I would say…

00:28:19.322 --> 00:28:22.909
Um… When you're angry like this,
you're so beautiful.

00:28:27.622 --> 00:28:28.623
Fool!

00:28:29.666 --> 00:28:31.584
You have no sense of decorum, do you?

00:28:32.085 --> 00:28:33.336
Confound it.

00:28:33.920 --> 00:28:35.380
I am so angry.

00:28:35.463 --> 00:28:37.716
I am very angry.

00:28:45.682 --> 00:28:47.183
Uh, excuse me.

00:28:47.767 --> 00:28:50.103
This is a counterfeit drawing.

00:28:50.186 --> 00:28:52.939
What difference could that make
for erotic paintings?

00:28:53.022 --> 00:28:55.108
If they're provocative,
that's all that counts.

00:28:55.191 --> 00:28:57.902
All the erotic paintings
that you've gathered so far

00:28:58.737 --> 00:29:02.532
are merely serviceable copies,
and they're spreading all over Hanyang.

00:29:03.199 --> 00:29:06.077
It isn't just one or two.
There must be dozens of them.

00:29:06.161 --> 00:29:08.580
In fact, by now there must be
hundreds of them.

00:29:09.372 --> 00:29:11.833
You won't be finished anytime soon.

00:29:19.257 --> 00:29:22.177
Before his lord arrives,
see to it that the servants…

00:29:28.516 --> 00:29:29.517
Madam?

00:29:33.772 --> 00:29:34.773
Gye-hwa…

00:29:35.774 --> 00:29:36.775
Yes, madam?

00:29:37.358 --> 00:29:39.903
Send So-ok and the servants
out of the house.

00:29:40.487 --> 00:29:42.280
And bolt the gate as quick as you can.

00:29:42.947 --> 00:29:45.450
Uh. Yes. Right away, madam.

00:29:52.457 --> 00:29:55.418
-What's going on?
-Does anyone know what this is about?

00:29:55.502 --> 00:29:57.295
Has my cousin arrived yet?

00:29:57.378 --> 00:29:58.880
No, he has not arrived yet.

00:29:58.963 --> 00:30:00.548
When he gets here, tell me at once.

00:30:00.632 --> 00:30:01.925
Yes, ma'am.

00:30:02.425 --> 00:30:03.468
Let's hurry.

00:30:32.121 --> 00:30:34.374
Your courage is quite remarkable.

00:30:36.000 --> 00:30:38.545
Mocking your sworn agreement
to pass on with honor…

00:30:39.379 --> 00:30:41.589
What possessed you to come back here?

00:30:42.674 --> 00:30:44.217
My shame is mine alone.

00:30:52.767 --> 00:30:54.644
Let's hear your explanation.

00:30:55.687 --> 00:30:57.105
Why are you here now?

00:30:57.188 --> 00:30:59.190
Why did you choose to see me like this?

00:31:06.155 --> 00:31:07.907
Please persuade my lord.

00:31:07.991 --> 00:31:09.909
What are you attempting to say?

00:31:12.287 --> 00:31:13.371
My lord

00:31:14.622 --> 00:31:18.960
has been given an order
to find and retrieve my lifeless remains.

00:31:22.797 --> 00:31:24.632
He told me to go away first,

00:31:25.800 --> 00:31:28.052
that he would find some way
to find me later.

00:31:34.017 --> 00:31:35.518
You're saying that my cousin

00:31:36.519 --> 00:31:38.021
said all of that to you?

00:31:39.606 --> 00:31:42.191
He made me swear to him
that I would go ahead…

00:31:43.151 --> 00:31:45.445
go until I found a secure place to hide.

00:31:50.992 --> 00:31:53.202
But I fear if my lord lies

00:31:53.286 --> 00:31:56.456
to the king because of me,
his life will be in peril.

00:31:59.250 --> 00:32:01.920
I cannot go forward alone
and leave my lord behind.

00:32:08.968 --> 00:32:12.096
If you are so worried
about the life of my dear cousin…

00:32:14.098 --> 00:32:17.310
could you not save him
by eliminating the lie all together?

00:32:25.735 --> 00:32:26.736
Whoa.

00:32:27.570 --> 00:32:29.322
Ah, my lord.

00:32:30.031 --> 00:32:31.449
Is something the matter?

00:32:32.033 --> 00:32:33.034
Well, now…

00:32:34.702 --> 00:32:36.788
My cousin shows romantic affections,

00:32:37.455 --> 00:32:39.457
and suddenly you are afraid to die?

00:32:40.750 --> 00:32:44.587
Now your chastity and the honor
of your family mean nothing to you?

00:32:45.505 --> 00:32:47.757
Do all your principles no longer matter?

00:32:50.718 --> 00:32:51.886
Oh, my lady.

00:32:52.512 --> 00:32:56.474
If your affection is truly deep enough
to save one who is condemned,

00:32:57.558 --> 00:33:00.436
why did you not intervene
in a more intimate way?

00:33:01.020 --> 00:33:03.064
You brought your trouble
instead into this house.

00:33:03.982 --> 00:33:06.401
Tell me why I should aid in such behavior.

00:33:10.321 --> 00:33:12.073
Weak, cowardly woman.

00:33:15.743 --> 00:33:16.995
Hmm.

00:33:17.078 --> 00:33:18.329
Mm-hmm.

00:33:18.413 --> 00:33:19.497
I am weak.

00:33:24.210 --> 00:33:26.629
However, the only place that came to mind

00:33:27.588 --> 00:33:29.090
was here with you.

00:33:30.550 --> 00:33:31.843
Madam, did you not…

00:33:34.512 --> 00:33:36.681
make me a confidant with your secret?

00:33:36.764 --> 00:33:38.766
Did we not form a friendship together?

00:33:38.850 --> 00:33:40.685
You're bringing up my secret…

00:33:41.352 --> 00:33:42.812
Is that true friendship?

00:33:44.731 --> 00:33:46.232
I beg of you, my lady.

00:33:47.275 --> 00:33:50.194
I ask that you simply persuade my lord.

00:33:51.070 --> 00:33:53.072
He must not speak to His Majesty.

00:33:54.032 --> 00:33:55.199
My lady!

00:33:55.700 --> 00:33:57.368
Lord Cho Won…

00:34:20.641 --> 00:34:22.935
Exactly why have you come here?

00:34:23.519 --> 00:34:25.521
To appeal for the aid of my lady.

00:34:27.356 --> 00:34:29.609
I cannot go on my own
and leave you behind.

00:34:39.786 --> 00:34:41.537
I beg of you, madam.

00:34:41.621 --> 00:34:43.289
Please, you must tell him.

00:34:43.372 --> 00:34:45.541
Tell him he must not go to His Majesty.

00:34:45.625 --> 00:34:47.585
Tell him to come away with me.

00:34:59.138 --> 00:35:02.809
Since you are earnest,
I shall do your bidding.

00:35:12.652 --> 00:35:16.697
I shall assist both of you
to go away together.

00:35:17.865 --> 00:35:20.409
For I am not
without a compassionate heart.

00:35:21.994 --> 00:35:23.079
However…

00:35:25.540 --> 00:35:28.292
Dear cousin, I wish to hear these words
from your own mouth.

00:35:29.168 --> 00:35:31.254
Tell me your intentions.

00:35:33.589 --> 00:35:34.715
Tell me truly.

00:35:35.341 --> 00:35:37.969
Will you be leaving,
you and this woman, together?

00:35:50.106 --> 00:35:52.817
I pray that we will leave
this place together.

00:35:56.362 --> 00:35:57.363
I…

00:36:03.870 --> 00:36:05.621
Will I have the strength to leave?

00:36:06.831 --> 00:36:07.832
My lord.

00:36:11.752 --> 00:36:13.462
I fought to avoid it…

00:36:16.591 --> 00:36:20.052
though I won't escape
what has appeared in my heart.

00:36:21.554 --> 00:36:24.307
I could no sooner do the same
after you left, my lord.

00:36:26.309 --> 00:36:27.643
That is pure affection.

00:36:33.524 --> 00:36:34.525
Yes.

00:36:37.278 --> 00:36:39.405
There is someone that is dear to me.

00:37:16.234 --> 00:37:17.568
Is this a dream?

00:37:20.238 --> 00:37:22.990
It would be so simple
for you to leave with me.

00:37:26.202 --> 00:37:28.579
It was of me
that you were speaking, right?

00:38:05.199 --> 00:38:07.451
Have you decided which path to take?

00:38:08.452 --> 00:38:11.122
Will you choose
to change his lies into the truth

00:38:11.205 --> 00:38:13.416
in order to save my dear cousin
from danger?

00:38:14.292 --> 00:38:16.252
Or will you choose to leave here

00:38:16.335 --> 00:38:19.046
and live your life quietly,
as though you were dead?

00:38:19.547 --> 00:38:24.427
Would it please you if I could devise
a way for you to live in solitude?

00:38:26.095 --> 00:38:27.722
You would need to choose.

00:38:35.354 --> 00:38:36.480
My lord?

00:39:33.621 --> 00:39:34.830
Tell me now.

00:39:36.540 --> 00:39:37.917
Was your affection real?

00:39:40.503 --> 00:39:41.587
Real?

00:39:44.382 --> 00:39:49.678
Let's say, when she was begging like that,
for me to leave with her…

00:39:55.059 --> 00:39:57.144
you could say that
what I was feeling was real.

00:39:58.687 --> 00:39:59.688
Now, cousin…

00:39:59.772 --> 00:40:02.942
I was pained to see her cling to me
as I desperately clung to you.

00:40:04.610 --> 00:40:05.736
And yet,

00:40:06.529 --> 00:40:08.948
that is precisely when it became clear…

00:40:11.200 --> 00:40:12.410
that you, cousin…

00:40:14.286 --> 00:40:16.622
never meant to run off with me at all.

00:40:20.084 --> 00:40:22.086
I could not take her away with me,

00:40:22.628 --> 00:40:25.756
and so I fabricated some dreams
and ramblings.

00:40:27.842 --> 00:40:30.469
"Shall we cross the sea or go to Yanjing?"

00:40:32.972 --> 00:40:35.015
I came to know how it is for you.

00:40:38.060 --> 00:40:41.480
From the start, you knew that
leaving with me was an impossible thing.

00:40:49.697 --> 00:40:51.198
I trembled at that.

00:40:57.955 --> 00:40:59.874
At the thought of being abandoned.

00:41:01.584 --> 00:41:02.751
What irony.

00:41:20.394 --> 00:41:22.188
Dear cousin, you must know…

00:41:24.064 --> 00:41:26.442
the bond between us can never be severed.

00:41:26.525 --> 00:41:28.652
Why can you not comprehend it?

00:41:29.361 --> 00:41:30.404
As promised,

00:41:31.155 --> 00:41:33.532
you have reported the matter
of the young widow and…

00:41:35.534 --> 00:41:36.535
I pray…

00:41:38.078 --> 00:41:40.331
Please return to me, my dear cousin.

00:41:48.047 --> 00:41:51.592
I wish to know each and every detail

00:41:52.593 --> 00:41:55.346
and everything you can read
in His Majesty's face

00:41:55.846 --> 00:41:59.475
when he replies
to the words I've put down.

00:42:03.604 --> 00:42:04.605
Pray…

00:42:05.898 --> 00:42:08.067
You will report back to me, will you not?

00:42:30.464 --> 00:42:32.299
As you wish, dear cousin.

00:42:38.264 --> 00:42:39.515
You can count on me.

00:43:50.127 --> 00:43:52.254
Tell me why you chose to approach me…

00:43:55.716 --> 00:43:58.886
when obviously another woman
is the object of your affections?

00:44:02.598 --> 00:44:05.267
Your chastity was the object
of a wager we made.

00:44:07.519 --> 00:44:10.189
I couldn't hold your body
and your heart in my hand.

00:44:14.193 --> 00:44:17.655
It was my chance to win the heart
of the one I yearned for my whole life.

00:44:20.574 --> 00:44:24.703
It was a… a wager
I could not sensibly refuse.

00:44:27.414 --> 00:44:29.458
My virtue and honor are now gone…

00:44:33.128 --> 00:44:35.631
because you wanted
to possess another woman then?

00:44:39.259 --> 00:44:40.803
That is the truth, yes.

00:44:46.725 --> 00:44:48.143
You are depraved.

00:44:55.526 --> 00:44:57.778
Are her virtues now corrupted as well?

00:44:59.655 --> 00:45:00.656
They're not.

00:45:01.740 --> 00:45:02.783
Why is that?

00:45:03.909 --> 00:45:05.953
If you chose to cause me so much shame…

00:45:07.579 --> 00:45:09.581
why would you not have taken hers?

00:45:28.684 --> 00:45:31.019
The Left State Councilor's house
is nearby.

00:45:32.271 --> 00:45:35.607
I fear that someone will spot you here.

00:45:55.878 --> 00:45:58.338
I will no more ask you of any great favor.

00:46:00.466 --> 00:46:02.050
But please don't die.

00:46:02.968 --> 00:46:04.678
Live on and live well.

00:46:08.682 --> 00:46:11.685
I fear I hold deep resentment
towards you, my lord.

00:46:20.444 --> 00:46:22.738
However, mortality is my claim.

00:46:33.957 --> 00:46:36.418
Despite the rage
that now dwells in my heart.

00:48:51.261 --> 00:48:54.306
Cheong, come in here now.

00:48:56.975 --> 00:49:01.146
If you please,
I feel a need to dress beautifully.

00:49:34.554 --> 00:49:37.808
Your mastery of the written language
is indeed surprising.

00:49:38.850 --> 00:49:41.687
I see you were unable
to retrieve the body.

00:49:42.521 --> 00:49:44.398
But with the help of your words,

00:49:44.898 --> 00:49:48.276
the tragic image
of her dignified death is very clear.

00:49:49.152 --> 00:49:52.531
That said, the Left State Councilor
must be informed as well.

00:49:53.031 --> 00:49:54.616
Tell me more about the witness.

00:50:01.832 --> 00:50:05.836
A papermaker witnessed it.
He saw the instant of her death.

00:50:05.919 --> 00:50:08.797
He is the supplier
for the Hwaseong construction.

00:50:08.880 --> 00:50:10.841
According to his recollections…

00:50:12.551 --> 00:50:14.845
it was in the morning.
The hour was very early.

00:50:14.928 --> 00:50:16.096
There was water gushing,

00:50:16.179 --> 00:50:18.181
because of the heavy rain,
toward the cliff.

00:50:18.682 --> 00:50:21.268
He filled his bucket,
and when he looked up,

00:50:21.935 --> 00:50:24.980
he saw a noblewoman weeping
in bitter sorrow.

00:50:25.480 --> 00:50:29.484
But then, in the blink of an eye,
she went over the cliff

00:50:30.318 --> 00:50:32.612
and plummeted to the river below.

00:50:36.283 --> 00:50:40.245
The river was flooded,
so no one could find the lady's remains.

00:50:40.912 --> 00:50:42.247
That coincides with the day

00:50:42.330 --> 00:50:45.751
the daughter-in-law's brother
began dispatching people to find her.

00:50:46.251 --> 00:50:47.252
That very day.

00:50:50.047 --> 00:50:52.340
It had to be the daughter-in-law
who jumped in.

00:50:56.470 --> 00:50:58.930
Your Majesty, I am afraid…

00:50:59.514 --> 00:51:02.267
…it was my oversight
that caused this pain.

00:51:02.350 --> 00:51:05.312
I humbly beg you
not to approve the Memorial Gate.

00:51:05.395 --> 00:51:06.605
That is not right.

00:51:07.230 --> 00:51:10.609
Is there among us a man
with the power to stop the heavy rain?

00:51:11.193 --> 00:51:13.403
Hear my words, Left State Councilor.

00:51:13.487 --> 00:51:16.073
Approval has been granted
for the Memorial Gate.

00:51:16.156 --> 00:51:17.657
You must accept this.

00:51:22.537 --> 00:51:24.998
Your Majesty, I am utterly overwhelmed

00:51:25.082 --> 00:51:26.249
by your boundless grace.

00:51:26.333 --> 00:51:28.335
I am utterly overwhelmed.

00:51:43.350 --> 00:51:45.977
I merely obeyed the command
that was given to me.

00:51:58.615 --> 00:51:59.741
Cho Won, come over here.

00:52:02.744 --> 00:52:03.745
Follow me.

00:52:11.503 --> 00:52:17.342
I consider this construction work to be
the most important undertaking of my life.

00:52:17.425 --> 00:52:21.179
Therefore, since my body
is confined to the palace,

00:52:21.263 --> 00:52:24.641
I depend on the confidential accounts
of many officials

00:52:25.142 --> 00:52:28.311
concerning conditions and circumstances
throughout Hwaseong daily.

00:52:28.395 --> 00:52:33.733
On the day prior to when the deceased
threw herself into the river…

00:52:35.318 --> 00:52:38.363
a light shower fell briefly in Hwaseong,
correct?

00:52:42.826 --> 00:52:44.411
Well, speak. I'm listening.

00:52:47.080 --> 00:52:50.500
Thinking I could be misled
with such paltry poppycock…

00:52:51.543 --> 00:52:53.295
Why would you even try?

00:53:07.642 --> 00:53:09.728
Is there something that you can't say?

00:53:09.811 --> 00:53:13.106
Or someone you would protect,
even if it costs you your life?

00:53:16.151 --> 00:53:18.320
You are just as you have always been.

00:53:18.820 --> 00:53:21.448
You wag your tongue
with no thought of consequences.

00:53:23.116 --> 00:53:24.117
However…

00:53:24.784 --> 00:53:27.120
I have always envied that about you too.

00:53:28.538 --> 00:53:32.334
In all my life, I have never
drawn a breath as my own person.

00:53:33.668 --> 00:53:37.631
Always living in the shadow
of the late king, as someone's son.

00:53:37.714 --> 00:53:40.926
Yes, I envy you, for you live untethered,

00:53:41.760 --> 00:53:43.094
flying free.

00:53:46.681 --> 00:53:49.351
That is why I have prized you so dearly.

00:53:50.101 --> 00:53:52.562
That's why I kept you close,
though you were hardly ready,

00:53:52.646 --> 00:53:54.314
and watched you act in my stead.

00:53:54.898 --> 00:53:57.192
I hoped you could be my trusted confidant.

00:53:57.776 --> 00:53:58.818
Your Highness…

00:54:02.113 --> 00:54:04.241
I humbly beg you to hear what I say.

00:54:06.243 --> 00:54:07.702
To tell you the truth…

00:54:11.373 --> 00:54:13.750
I'm like a bird locked up in a cage.

00:54:16.002 --> 00:54:18.004
Never once have I taken flight.

00:54:26.221 --> 00:54:28.223
Cho Won, hear what I say.

00:54:30.392 --> 00:54:32.852
For daring to offend
and insult the sovereign,

00:54:32.936 --> 00:54:35.313
our friendship is ended forthwith.

00:54:35.814 --> 00:54:36.982
Never again

00:54:37.649 --> 00:54:40.402
shall you be granted an audience with me.

00:55:36.249 --> 00:55:40.170
His Majesty was greatly moved
by the words you wrote, dear cousin.

00:55:40.670 --> 00:55:42.922
You described that death so vividly

00:55:43.006 --> 00:55:47.510
that His Majesty seemed more affected
by the sorrow of losing one of his people

00:55:47.594 --> 00:55:50.096
than by the gravity of the Memorial Gate.

00:55:50.180 --> 00:55:53.183
Thus, the Memorial Gate for Virtuous Women

00:55:53.266 --> 00:55:55.810
shall be bestowed upon
the Left State Councilor's family.

00:55:55.894 --> 00:55:58.229
What trouble you've taken
to carry so precious a letter.

00:55:58.813 --> 00:55:59.856
Thank you, madam.

00:56:00.815 --> 00:56:02.150
Gye-hwa, are you outside?

00:56:02.233 --> 00:56:03.735
Please prepare some drinks…

00:56:03.818 --> 00:56:05.987
-Yes, madam.
-…for when my cousin arrives.

00:56:06.488 --> 00:56:10.367
No. That's all right.
I think I'll go and wait outside.

00:56:25.465 --> 00:56:26.758
You arrive just in time.

00:56:26.841 --> 00:56:27.842
Though I…

00:56:28.885 --> 00:56:30.095
Are you going to be alone?

00:56:30.178 --> 00:56:33.765
I was told there was a lady,
so I came to escort her.

00:56:34.641 --> 00:56:36.518
Well, this is how it turned out.

00:56:37.727 --> 00:56:38.770
Now then…

00:56:40.355 --> 00:56:43.650
I shall pay you the same fare,
so let's go now.

00:56:45.193 --> 00:56:46.403
Very well.

00:56:50.115 --> 00:56:52.200
All right then, here we go.

00:56:53.743 --> 00:56:57.080
All right. Let us depart.

00:58:03.021 --> 00:58:05.064
What business do you have in Yanjing?

00:58:05.648 --> 00:58:09.068
It doesn't look to me
like you are going there to study.

00:58:13.406 --> 00:58:14.991
You do have a sharp eye.

00:58:16.534 --> 00:58:18.286
You're not going off to live in hiding

00:58:18.369 --> 00:58:20.413
after committing some great offense,
are you?

00:58:21.206 --> 00:58:23.082
That would put me in some jeopardy.

00:58:26.085 --> 00:58:27.795
A life of chasing women…

00:58:30.048 --> 00:58:33.718
Now two of them are chasing me.
How vile is that?

00:58:33.801 --> 00:58:36.387
So now I'm making a…

00:58:37.972 --> 00:58:39.724
…a run for it in the dead of night.

00:58:42.227 --> 00:58:44.187
Oh. Only two, you say?

00:58:45.021 --> 00:58:48.316
I wouldn't mind three.
Even four would be no problem!

00:58:54.614 --> 00:58:58.117
Uh, you just say the word,
and I'll turn the boat around.

00:58:58.618 --> 00:59:02.413
It doesn't seem that you particularly
wish to run away, that's for sure.

00:59:03.164 --> 00:59:06.834
If I turn around now,
I'll only charge you half the fare, okay?

00:59:10.880 --> 00:59:13.216
Who do I have to go back to anyway?

00:59:32.569 --> 00:59:33.820
My lord?

00:59:34.571 --> 00:59:35.572
Oh, my goodness!

00:59:35.655 --> 00:59:37.365
Oh, goodness! My lord!

00:59:41.786 --> 00:59:42.912
My lord!

00:59:46.082 --> 00:59:48.376
My lord! My lord!

01:00:09.105 --> 01:00:10.607
Blast it! Good heavens!

01:00:10.690 --> 01:00:13.276
Do you know how hard it is
to be born a nobleman?

01:00:13.776 --> 01:00:14.777
Damn it.

01:00:15.361 --> 01:00:17.030
Oh, for goodness' sakes!

01:00:48.728 --> 01:00:50.647
Keep the pace now!

01:00:50.730 --> 01:00:53.191
Let's go, let's go. No slowing down!

01:00:55.902 --> 01:00:58.780
Mister, I'm off to make deliveries
to Hanyang.

01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:00.907
-All right.
-I'm going along with him.

01:01:00.990 --> 01:01:02.408
I packed some snacks.

01:01:02.492 --> 01:01:03.493
Yes, go.

01:01:03.993 --> 01:01:05.536
But keep your eyes open.

01:01:05.620 --> 01:01:08.956
Who can say?
Lord Cho Won could still be in the area.

01:01:10.917 --> 01:01:13.795
What use is it to meet
a heartless noble like him?

01:01:13.878 --> 01:01:15.505
Are you an idiot, man?

01:01:16.464 --> 01:01:18.257
He freed you, didn't he?

01:01:18.758 --> 01:01:20.093
He paid to have Eun-sil released.

01:01:20.176 --> 01:01:22.637
Even asked me to see to it
you could make a living.

01:01:22.720 --> 01:01:24.055
And that's all you have to say?

01:01:24.138 --> 01:01:25.223
Come on.

01:01:26.140 --> 01:01:27.600
I was upset. That's all.

01:01:29.394 --> 01:01:31.396
I don't know if he's dead or alive.

01:01:31.896 --> 01:01:34.691
And if he's alive,
he could've sent word to me.

01:01:37.443 --> 01:01:39.904
Off with you. Do your errands. Hurry back.

01:01:40.822 --> 01:01:41.823
We're leaving.

01:01:47.829 --> 01:01:50.915
This paper is always good quality.
Thank you very much.

01:01:51.499 --> 01:01:54.419
I was careful to choose
the best of the best, of course.

01:01:54.919 --> 01:01:57.422
I am very glad it brought you delight.

01:01:58.297 --> 01:02:00.341
Is your work going well then?

01:02:00.425 --> 01:02:01.592
Not too difficult, I hope?

01:02:01.676 --> 01:02:03.010
Oh, dear.

01:02:03.094 --> 01:02:05.471
To live as a proper human isn't difficult.

01:02:06.180 --> 01:02:08.099
I only wish that my lord…

01:02:14.272 --> 01:02:16.941
May I… May I be on my way now?

01:02:33.166 --> 01:02:34.834
I will deliver this, of course…

01:02:35.626 --> 01:02:37.837
But why do you keep writing them
when there's no reply?

01:02:37.920 --> 01:02:39.213
Would you kindly take it?

01:02:42.675 --> 01:02:45.553
I heard there's a new sister
who's joining us today.

01:02:45.636 --> 01:02:49.015
We've recently had many new sisters,
much more than usual.

01:02:49.098 --> 01:02:50.767
And a welcome thing that is indeed.

01:02:50.850 --> 01:02:52.185
She should be here by now.

01:02:55.271 --> 01:02:57.523
-She's here. Mmm.
-Oh.

01:03:04.781 --> 01:03:06.365
Here. Go on.

01:03:07.283 --> 01:03:08.284
Welcome.

01:03:08.367 --> 01:03:12.246
I'm very sorry. It's my first time,
and I guess I was a little late.

01:03:13.873 --> 01:03:16.459
Everybody is here. We can begin.

01:03:18.753 --> 01:03:21.506
A vow, when made before God,

01:03:21.589 --> 01:03:24.467
ought to be in accordance
with what is true and just.

01:03:26.677 --> 01:03:29.931
I was told we needed more candles
for our new arrivals.

01:03:30.014 --> 01:03:32.183
-Ah. Hmm.
-…then this is an insult to God,

01:03:32.266 --> 01:03:34.060
and a mockery of his grace.

01:03:34.143 --> 01:03:37.563
Therefore, we must always be sincere.

01:03:38.606 --> 01:03:39.982
Why, of course.

01:03:40.066 --> 01:03:42.860
You can't expect to live well,
if you live a life of lies, can you?

01:03:44.445 --> 01:03:45.530
That is true.

01:03:45.613 --> 01:03:47.740
I am correct. Am I not correct?

01:03:47.824 --> 01:03:49.158
-Mmm.
-Yes.

01:03:50.159 --> 01:03:51.786
Let us continue.

01:03:53.120 --> 01:03:56.415
Even if you refrain
from invoking the holy name of God,

01:03:57.166 --> 01:04:01.170
the sin is the same as if you did
call upon that holy name of God.

01:04:02.880 --> 01:04:06.801
Heaven, earth, and all things

01:04:06.884 --> 01:04:09.595
were indeed created by God for humankind.

01:04:09.679 --> 01:04:11.681
Why?

01:04:11.764 --> 01:04:13.140
Why aren't you going inside?

01:04:14.016 --> 01:04:15.393
Are you just going to leave?

01:04:16.811 --> 01:04:17.812
Mmm.

01:04:18.688 --> 01:04:20.982
I have some business
to attend to right away.

01:04:22.400 --> 01:04:23.818
I'm making this humble request.

01:04:23.901 --> 01:04:26.571
…and therefore, the Mother of God

01:04:26.654 --> 01:04:30.575
has designated one special day
out of every seven days.

01:04:30.658 --> 01:04:34.078
And this is called the Lord's Day.

01:04:42.795 --> 01:04:43.796
Amen.

01:05:07.486 --> 01:05:09.697
Ever on goes time

01:05:09.780 --> 01:05:13.284
Flowers all bloom

01:05:13.993 --> 01:05:17.872
Bees and butterflies

01:05:17.955 --> 01:05:19.123
Oh, young master!

01:05:19.206 --> 01:05:20.541
Come flying

01:05:20.625 --> 01:05:24.003
-It is nature's way
-Oh!

01:05:24.086 --> 01:05:26.172
That doesn't mean

01:05:26.255 --> 01:05:28.507
it always aligns with the moral order.

01:05:28.591 --> 01:05:29.842
That's nonsense!

01:05:29.926 --> 01:05:32.470
What do you mean
the natural order isn't the moral order?

01:05:32.553 --> 01:05:33.846
As the saying goes!

01:05:33.930 --> 01:05:36.599
What you've planted here
Will be what you'll reap

01:05:36.682 --> 01:05:39.393
It's obvious

01:05:39.477 --> 01:05:43.481
A three-year-old child would know that

01:05:43.564 --> 01:05:46.776
If you said a noble woman

01:05:46.859 --> 01:05:49.028
Would throw her pillow

01:05:49.111 --> 01:05:53.115
I swear… I would believe that

01:05:53.199 --> 01:05:56.285
More than what you're saying

01:05:56.369 --> 01:06:00.456
-That crying doesn't sound ordinary
-How could they do this? How could they?

01:06:00.539 --> 01:06:02.291
-I can't take it!
-Oh! Oh, dear.

01:06:02.375 --> 01:06:05.086
Oh! Oh, my. Look, look, look, look.

01:06:06.879 --> 01:06:09.090
It seems she is still full of life.

01:06:09.173 --> 01:06:12.635
Even Buddha himself
couldn't overcome boiling rage.

01:06:12.718 --> 01:06:15.096
Indeed. Blessed are those who endure.

01:06:15.179 --> 01:06:18.265
Hear the temple's moktak,
tak, tak, tak, tak…

01:06:18.349 --> 01:06:21.560
Neighboring red-bean
Fell into a field of beans

01:06:21.644 --> 01:06:25.731
And so it happened, it got mixed in
Entwined and entangled all together

01:06:25.815 --> 01:06:30.152
Bukchon's noble gentry all pretend
They don't notice it

01:06:30.236 --> 01:06:33.364
As they're all drunk
On liquor and power

01:06:33.447 --> 01:06:38.202
Isn't it such a joy
To practice and to learn?

01:06:38.285 --> 01:06:40.079
Come this way! This way!

01:06:40.162 --> 01:06:42.957
Hmm…Then you might as well
Raise one leg, good grief!

01:06:43.040 --> 01:06:45.334
I don't know what you're learning
Or what you're practicing

01:06:45.418 --> 01:06:51.090
However, it is still such a big joy

01:06:52.049 --> 01:06:56.971
Even butterflies
Sipping from white flowers

01:06:57.054 --> 01:06:59.306
Go back to where they came from

01:06:59.390 --> 01:07:03.060
Once their lives have run their course

01:07:03.144 --> 01:07:07.398
And still we see springtime
Coming once more

01:07:07.481 --> 01:07:09.358
But then… why hasn't it sprouted?

01:07:09.442 --> 01:07:12.153
Black beans, chickpeas, speckled beans
What about kidney beans?

01:07:12.236 --> 01:07:14.488
Soybeans
Beans, beans, beans, beans!

01:07:14.572 --> 01:07:16.949
What kind of bean did you plant
that it won't sprout?

01:07:17.033 --> 01:07:18.868
What do you mean, what kind of bean?

01:07:18.951 --> 01:07:23.873
Well, one that was sitting for years
All dried up

01:07:23.956 --> 01:07:26.584
And with no germ inside

01:07:26.667 --> 01:07:29.962
It's that bean that I planted,
and you know what happened?

01:07:30.046 --> 01:07:31.756
Well, it did actually sprout.

01:07:31.839 --> 01:07:34.842
It wasn't supposed to sprout,
but somehow it did?

01:07:34.925 --> 01:07:37.094
Doesn't it mean
everything turned out perfectly?

01:07:37.178 --> 01:07:38.971
Didn't you watch Episode 1?

01:07:39.055 --> 01:07:41.390
Stop saying nonsense
and go watch it again.

01:07:41.474 --> 01:07:43.559
Don't you see?

01:07:43.642 --> 01:07:46.312
This sprout is actually
not that kind of sprout.

01:07:46.395 --> 01:07:48.564
If that sprout isn't that kind of sprout,

01:07:48.647 --> 01:07:50.900
then that sprout shows no promise at all.

01:07:50.983 --> 01:07:52.735
It's a matter of principle.

01:07:52.818 --> 01:07:55.029
The natural order can't be helped.

01:07:55.112 --> 01:07:57.114
Then at least follow the right way.

01:07:57.198 --> 01:08:00.701
This way, that way This way, that way

01:08:00.785 --> 01:08:03.621
-What's that supposed to mean?
-What do you mean?

01:08:03.704 --> 01:08:05.915
It means a dog ran off that way.

01:08:05.998 --> 01:08:09.043
Oh, boy.
Speak of the devil. Here she comes.

01:08:09.126 --> 01:08:11.545
She'll never be a lady.

01:08:11.629 --> 01:08:14.381
Honestly, she has no shame.
Look, look, look, look, look.

01:08:14.465 --> 01:08:17.384
No, but really look at her.
How can she show her face?

01:08:17.468 --> 01:08:20.429
Come now. A mother-in-law
always loves her son-in-law.

01:08:20.513 --> 01:08:21.972
True.

01:08:22.056 --> 01:08:25.267
Green belongs with green
Crayfish sides with crab

01:08:25.351 --> 01:08:28.437
Blood is thicker than water

01:08:28.521 --> 01:08:31.690
Birds of a feather flock together

01:08:31.774 --> 01:08:34.235
Each with their own

01:08:34.944 --> 01:08:38.072
They all look so dignified

01:08:38.155 --> 01:08:41.283
Yet they are nobles in name
And nothing more

01:08:41.367 --> 01:08:44.370
It may not even be A bean seed

01:08:44.453 --> 01:08:47.498
Maybe it is a red bean seed…

01:08:47.581 --> 01:08:54.505
Her looks will not betray her
When she is burning with anger inside

01:08:54.588 --> 01:08:58.092
They worked so hard
To keep it all secret, but still…

01:08:59.176 --> 01:09:04.056
Listen, and you'll hear whispers
Hearsay, chitchat, rumor, and gossip

01:09:04.140 --> 01:09:05.683
It's everywhere

01:09:05.766 --> 01:09:06.767
Everywhere

01:09:06.851 --> 01:09:11.564
Thanks to the tireless tongues
Of the ladies of Bukchon, all the time

01:09:11.647 --> 01:09:16.277
Everyone who should know already knows
Everyone except Lord Yoo

01:09:16.360 --> 01:09:17.778
He must not know
For if he did

01:09:17.862 --> 01:09:20.197
Then he would never act this way

01:09:21.031 --> 01:09:25.244
No one would ever act like that

01:09:26.245 --> 01:09:29.874
Goodness, my friend
Still this? Even now?

01:09:30.499 --> 01:09:33.919
See all the noblemen
Of Bukchon know it all

01:09:34.003 --> 01:09:37.381
But just pretend they don't

01:09:37.923 --> 01:09:39.425
My word…

01:09:39.508 --> 01:09:44.180
I'm really sure even master performers
Would envy today's gathering

01:09:44.263 --> 01:09:47.683
I admit, I'm so intimidated
I've nearly lost my voice

01:09:47.766 --> 01:09:49.435
-Now it's time for me to go
-He thinks he's funny.

01:09:49.518 --> 01:09:51.562
Next stop
Namchon's where I'm heading to

01:09:52.062 --> 01:09:57.276
Really, my legs are trembling, you know
It's my escape, a chance to go

01:09:58.986 --> 01:10:01.238
Yes, now go!

01:10:45.574 --> 01:10:47.117
Why trouble yourself?

01:10:48.911 --> 01:10:51.747
You have come all this way
when it's so cold.

01:10:52.248 --> 01:10:55.292
I suppose, if someone
is still sending him letters…

01:10:58.921 --> 01:11:04.426
it suggests that I'm not the only one
who can't believe that he is truly gone.

01:11:04.510 --> 01:11:10.266
For so many years, I've been living
in the company of the young master.

01:11:11.976 --> 01:11:13.018
So…

01:11:13.560 --> 01:11:17.189
If I may be bold,
I can maybe read his mind a little.

01:11:22.736 --> 01:11:25.030
"Go fetch her a little warm tea."

01:11:28.575 --> 01:11:30.202
That's what he would say.

01:11:33.872 --> 01:11:35.708
Please, go inside.

01:11:55.519 --> 01:11:56.603
Cousin!

01:12:01.317 --> 01:12:02.943
Dear cousin!

01:12:08.282 --> 01:12:09.658
Cousin!

01:12:42.816 --> 01:12:44.610
I have been doing well.

01:12:46.570 --> 01:12:50.616
I am living as I always have.

01:12:52.117 --> 01:12:53.243
Those moments

01:12:53.994 --> 01:12:58.207
when I suddenly find myself wondering
if you have truly left

01:12:58.290 --> 01:13:00.000
have grown more frequent.

01:13:02.503 --> 01:13:03.962
And every time,

01:13:04.880 --> 01:13:06.340
I think to myself…

01:13:08.967 --> 01:13:12.054
If only I had followed you, dear cousin,

01:13:12.137 --> 01:13:13.680
leaving nothing behind,

01:13:14.306 --> 01:13:15.391
perhaps…

01:13:16.475 --> 01:13:20.229
I would not have wound up with nothing
but this longing.

01:13:23.315 --> 01:13:24.608
Dear cousin,

01:13:25.317 --> 01:13:27.194
if, by any chance…

01:13:28.570 --> 01:13:33.325
you are out there, still alive,
and only pretending to be dead,

01:13:34.952 --> 01:13:37.329
then could you not return to me?

01:13:39.164 --> 01:13:42.501
I am dying here,

01:13:43.043 --> 01:13:45.879
even as I pretend to be alive.